                {"english": "A simple magnetic pocket compass shown by his father sparked his lifelong fascination with unseen forces.", "chinese": "父亲展示给他看的一只普通口袋磁罗盘，点燃了他终其一生探索无形物理隐秘力量的无限痴迷。"},
                {"english": "He disliked rigid authoritarian school memorization, preferring autonomous thought and conceptual violin improvisation.", "chinese": "他极其反感刻板专制的填鸭式死记硬背，而狂热偏爱独立自由思考与小提琴上的即兴思想交锋。"},
