                {"english": "Returning to a struggling Apple in 1997, he orchestrated the most dramatic corporate turnaround in history.", "chinese": "1997年当他临危受命重返濒临破产边缘的苹果公司时，他奇迹般统帅策划了世界商业史上最波澜壮阔的惊天大逆转。"},
                {"english": "He launched the iconic 'Think Different' advertising campaign, celebrating rebels, troublemakers, and visionaries.", "chinese": "他果断推出了震古烁今的“非同凡想”（Think Different）经典品牌战役，致敬那些桀骜不驯的叛徒、麻烦制造者与远见先驱。"},
                {"english": "He revolutionized multiple industries: the iPod reinvented music, while the iPhone redefined telecommunications completely.", "chinese": "他以一人之力颠覆重构了多个千亿级巨型产业：iPod重塑了数字音乐，而iPhone更是彻底颠覆重新定义了人类移动通信。"},
                {"english": "The iPad established tablet computing, merging hardware, software, and services into seamless consumer ecosystems.", "chinese": "iPad平板电脑横空出世，将硬核硬件工业设计、丝滑操作系统与云端服务生态高度无缝捏合成了一体。"},
                {"english": "He stood firmly at the intersection of technology, humanities, and liberal arts throughout his product designs.", "chinese": "在他的整条产品设计哲学血脉中，他始终坚定不移地站在现代科技、人文学科与自由人文艺术的黄金交叉十字路口。"},
                {"english": "Stay hungry, stay foolish, he famously urged graduating students in his iconic Stanford commencement speech.", "chinese": "“求知若饥，虚心若愚”（Stay hungry, stay foolish），在斯坦福大学那场举世闻名的毕业典礼演讲中，他深情寄语年轻一代。"},
                {"english": "Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication, remained the guiding mantra carved across every device he released.", "chinese": "“至繁归于至简，简洁方为终极的深邃与成熟”，这句至理名言作为不可动摇的设计信条，铭刻在他主导发布的每一款设备之中。"},
                {"english": "His relentless passion for aesthetic perfection left an indelible dent in the universe of modern culture.", "chinese": "他对工业美学至臻境界近乎偏执狂一般的执着狂热，在现代人类文明与数字科技的宏大宇宙中烙下了不可磨灭的凹痕。"}
