                {"english": "In 1969, during a malaria epidemic, she was appointed head of Project 523's secret research team.", "chinese": "1969年，在全球恶性疟疾肆虐失控的严峻关头，她受命挂帅出任国家绝密代号“523工程”中草药抗疟科研攻关组组长。"},
                {"english": "Malaria was killing millions globally, with resistant parasites rendering existing chloroquine treatments dangerously ineffective.", "chinese": "当时致命的疟原虫已对临床常用药物氯喹产生普遍恶性抗药性，导致全球每年数以百万计的鲜活生命惨遭夺走。"},
                {"english": "She combed through over two thousand classical Chinese medical texts, searching for ancient anti-malarial herbal formulations.", "chinese": "她夜以继日、通宵达旦翻阅梳理了两千多部中国历代中医经典古籍药典，苦苦搜寻古代抵御瘴气疟疾的草本古方。"},
