                {"english": "She realized that high boiling temperatures were destroying the active therapeutic chemical compounds inside sweet wormwood.", "chinese": "她敏锐地意识到：传统高温煎煮熬药的滚沸热度，极有可能早已将青蒿植株内部原本娇弱的有效活性化学成分彻底破坏殆尽。"},
                {"english": "Switching to low-temperature ether extraction, she successfully obtained an extract showing one hundred percent parasite inhibition.", "chinese": "她果断改用低温低沸点乙醚回流提取法，终于在第191次实验中成功获得了对疟原虫抑制率高达百分之百的奇迹提取物！"},
                {"english": "To accelerate urgent human clinical trials, she courageously volunteered to test the extract on herself first.", "chinese": "为了在最快时间内推动人体临床安全性验证，她义无反顾、挺身而出，以身试药充当了首批第一位人体活体实验志愿者！"},
                {"english": "Having confirmed absolute pharmacological safety in her own body, she rushed treatment to patients in Hainan.", "chinese": "在用自己的血肉之躯彻底证实了药剂的绝对安全性之后，她风尘仆仆星夜兼程赶赴海南疟疾重灾区展开临床救治。"},
                {"english": "The resulting miracle medicine, named artemisinin, cured malaria patients rapidly with virtually zero toxic side effects.", "chinese": "这味被正式命名为“青蒿素”的东方神药，不仅起效神速、杀虫彻底，而且几乎没有任何严重毒副反应，疗效惊艳中外。"},
                {"english": "Artemisinin combination therapies have saved millions of lives worldwide, particularly vulnerable impoverished children across Africa.", "chinese": "以青蒿素为核心的联合疗法拯救了全球数以百万计的垂危生命，尤其为非洲撒哈拉以南数以百万计的贫困儿童筑起了生命长城。"},
                {"english": "In 2015, she became the first mainland Chinese scientist to receive the Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine.", "chinese": "2015年，她破天荒荣获诺贝尔生理学或医学奖，成为首位荣获该项诺贝尔科学桂冠的中国本土科学家！"},
