                {"english": "As Sullivan spelled W-A-T-E-R onto her skin, Helen suddenly realized that the tactile word signified the liquid sensation.", "chinese": "正当莎莉文老师在她另一只手心飞快拼写W-A-T-E-R（水）之际，海伦猛然顿悟：这个触感符号指代的就是流过肌肤的清凉液体！"},
