                {"english": "She authored twelve influential books, including her celebrated timeless autobiographical masterpiece The Story of My Life.", "chinese": "她毕生笔耕不辍，撰写发表了十二部影响深远的著作，其中包括她那部名扬四海、催人泪下的传世自传经典《假如给我三天光明》。"},
                {"english": "She championed workers' rights, women's suffrage, anti-war pacifism, and disability support across thirty-five countries worldwide.", "chinese": "她作为举世闻名的社会活动家周游世界三十五国，不遗余力为底层劳工权益、妇女普选权、反战和平主义及残障群体大声疾呼。"},
